                &lt;div&gt;
                    
                        &lt;article&gt;
                            &lt;h2&gt;&lt;a href="https://github.com/StackExchange/StackExchange.Redis/releases/tag/3.0.47-preview"&gt;3.0.47-preview&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
                            &lt;div&gt;
                                &lt;h2&gt;What's Changed&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a preview release of SE.Redis v3. It should be production ready - we're not aware of any blocking issues.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Key changes:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Large re-implementation of the entire "read" path
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;No longer uses Pipelines.Sockets.Unofficial&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Much more efficient for deep/complex results&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;RESP3 is now used by default (see &lt;a href="https://stackexchange.github.io/StackExchange.Redis/Resp3" rel="nofollow"&gt;here&lt;/a&gt; for more info including how to force RESP2)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
                            &lt;/div&gt;
                        &lt;/article&gt;
                    
                &lt;/div&gt;
